{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-03801-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["현대차그룹은 마카롱택시를 운영하는 KST모빌리티와 함께 14일부터","지정좌석제로 운영","은평뉴타운 주민 100명을 선정해 3개월간 무료로 운영"],"reason":"The summary says Hyundai started the pilot and gives the 100-resident, 3-month free terms, but it never says what Shucle is or that KST Mobility is a partner at the start. It also muddles the relation by saying 'Shucle is held in Eunpyeong New Town'. The sentence repeats the 100-resident, 3-month detail, and it states the designated-seat system in the past tense ('운영됐다') even though the source describes it as introduced for the service."},"B":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":5,"utility":4,"evidence":["14일부터 커뮤니티형 모빌리티 서비스 ‘셔클’의 시범운영을 시작한다고 13일 밝혔다","주민 1명당 3명의 가족이 함께 이용"],"reason":"The summary is accurate and covers the partner, dates, location, scale, duration, family use and the plan for the main project in the second half. It leaves out the demand-responsive on-demand service concept and the sandbox. These are minor omissions."},"C":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["은평뉴타운 주민 100명을 선정해 3개월간 무료로 운영","자세한 내용은 셔클 홈페이지(www.shucle.com)에서 확인할 수 있다"],"reason":"The summary invents an application process, saying '신청자 100명' can sign up on the homepage. The source only says the homepage has details, and the 100 residents are selected. It repeats the 100-people, 3-month point, and it leaves out the Eunpyeong New Town location as the test site for the pilot."},"D":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":4,"evidence":["수요응답형 서비스","은평뉴타운 주민 100명을 선정해 3개월간 무료로 운영된다"],"reason":"The summary accurately conveys the service concept, location, vehicle, 100 residents, 3 months free and the plan for the main project. It leaves out the family-use detail and the sandbox. The first sentence is a little dense, but it reads fine."}}}
